        "adiego2017"
      ],
      "observations": [
        "On pp.2–3, Adiego explicitly uses circumflex-o for o/theta alternatives and circumflex-e for e/s alternatives. His Latin rendering and segmentation are analytical conventions over Greek-script evidence."
